  "body": "### Describe the feature you'd like to request\n\nOn the board manage page it would be great to have a board preview\n\n### Describe the solution you'd like to see\n\nThere are two possible solutions\r\n- Using screenshots with some sort of npm library, for example [capture-website](https://www.npmjs.com/package/capture-website)\r\n- Show a small version of the actual board with small preview cards as items [here is a branch](https://github.com/homarr-labs/homarr/tree/board-preview-do-not-delete)  with an example implementation\r\n\r\n\r\nThis feature should have low priority and not be done before 1.0\n\n### Additional information\n\n_No response_",
